# Tasks

::summary
The Tasks surface in the shell wrapper: title row with the task count and icon-only New Task + Filter actions (G3), list ⇄ board segmented-control (the NEW block kind — not a tab-bar style), SDLC stage-grouped list (all 8 stages, board order, empty groups collapse), and the kanban board view. The inline five-facet filter row is gone (WP-N3, docs G4 precedent): the facets live in `modals/filter.surf` (Tasks vocabulary), opened from the Filter button. The New Tasks sheet is `modals/create.surf` (Tasks kind) — no inline copy.
::

