## Filter sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/filter.surf` (`name=filter`, anchored to the title-row Filter button): one sheet, per-surface vocabulary — here the Tasks facets (Sort: Priority/Newest/Oldest, type, stage, priority, assignee), verbs unchanged (`applySort` / `scopeType` / `scopeStage` / `scopePriority` / `scopeAssignee`). The Filter button opens it via `toggleFilter`; this file carries no inline copy.

## New Tasks sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/create.surf` (`name=create`, Tasks kind: "Describe your goals" → Break into tasks → Review Tasks cards with Regenerate + "Add N"; "Create task manually instead" escape). The title-row New Task button opens it via `openCreateTasks`; this file carries no inline copy.
